{title: Likhe Jo Khat Tujhe}
{artist: Mohammed Rafi Shankar Jaikishan}
{key: Bm}

{c: Verse 1}
[Bm] Likhe jo khat tujhe,        [Bm] Woh teri yaad mein
Hazaaron rang [G] ke,        Nazaare ban ga [A] ye
Sawera jab hua [Bm],        To phool ban gaye
Jo raat aayi to [G],        Sitaare ban [A] gaye
[Bm] Likhe jo khat tujhe...        [Bm] Koi nagma kahin goonja
Kahan dil ne [Bm] Ye tu aayi,        Kahin [A] chatki kali [G] koi
Mai ye [A] samza tu [Bm] sharmai,        Koi [A] khushboo kahin bikhri
Laga yeh [G] zulf lehra [Bm] ayi,        [Bm] Likhe jo khat tujhe...
[Bm] Fiza rangeen,adaa rangeen,        [Bm] Yeh ithlaana,yeh sharmaana
Yeh angda [A] ayi Yeh tanha [G] yi,        Yeh tarsa [A] kar chale [Bm] jana
[A] Bana de ga nahi kisko,        Jawaan jadoo [G] yeh deewana [Bm]
[Bm] Likhe jo khat tujhe...        [Bm] Jaha tu hai wahan main hoon
[Bm] Mere dil ki tu dhadhkan hai,        [A] Musafir main tu man [G] zil hai
Mai py [A] asa hu tu sa [Bm] wan hai,        Meri [A] duniya yeh nazre hain
Meri jan [G] nat ye daman [Bm] hai,        [Bm] Likhe jo khat tujhe...
